SELECT ?item ?itemLabel ?count ?countBeschermd ?countPubliekdomein ?countOnbekend ?countWelgeboortedatum ?beschermdPercentage ?publiekdomeinPercentage  ?onbekendPercentage ?welgeboortedatumPercentage
WITH {
  SELECT DISTINCT ?item ?human WHERE {
    ?human wdt:P31 wd:Q5 .
    ?human wdt:P6379 ?item .
    FILTER (?item IN (wd:Q3912134))
  }
} AS %humans
WITH {
  SELECT DISTINCT ?human ?beschermd ?publiekdomein ?onbekend ?welgeboortedatum WHERE {
    INCLUDE %humans.
    OPTIONAL {
      ?human wdt:P7763 wd:Q73555012
      BIND(1 AS ?beschermd)
    }
    OPTIONAL {
      ?human wdt:P7763 wd:Q71887839
      BIND(1 AS ?publiekdomein)
    }
    OPTIONAL {
      FILTER NOT EXISTS
       {?human wdt:P7763 []
       }
      FILTER NOT EXISTS
       {?human wdt:P569 []
       }
      BIND(1 AS ?onbekend)
    }
    OPTIONAL {
      ?human wdt:P569 ?geboortedatum
      FILTER NOT EXISTS
       {?human wdt:P7763 []}
      BIND(1 AS ?welgeboortedatum)
    }
  }
} AS %humansWithRep
WITH {
  SELECT ?item (COUNT(?human) AS ?count) (SUM(?beschermd) AS ?countBeschermd) (CONCAT(str(ROUND(SUM(?beschermd)* 100 / (COUNT(?human)))), "% (", str(SUM(?beschermd)), " personen)") AS ?beschermdPercentage) (SUM(?publiekdomein) AS ?countPubliekdomein) (CONCAT(str(ROUND(SUM(?publiekdomein)* 100 / (COUNT(?human)))), "% (", str(SUM(?publiekdomein)), " personen)") AS ?publiekdomeinPercentage) (SUM(?onbekend) AS ?countOnbekend) (CONCAT(str(ROUND(SUM(?onbekend)* 100 / (COUNT(?human)))), "% (", str(SUM(?onbekend)), " personen)") AS ?onbekendPercentage) (SUM(?welgeboortedatum) AS ?countWelgeboortedatum) (CONCAT(str(ROUND(SUM(?welgeboortedatum)* 100 / (COUNT(?human)))), "% (", str(SUM(?welgeboortedatum)), " personen)") AS ?welgeboortedatumPercentage) WHERE {
    INCLUDE %humans.
    INCLUDE %humansWithRep.
  }
  GROUP BY ?item
} AS %items
WHERE {
  INCLUDE %items.
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "[AUTO_LANGUAGE],en". }
}
